heretic-cinematic-ash-1 = The Watch is dead. The Nightwatcher burned with it, yet his fire burns evermore.
heretic-cinematic-ash-2 = I stand among the charred. The first of many, that which will shine brighter than all stars in the sky.
heretic-cinematic-ash-3 = FOR DUST THOU ART, AND UNTO DUST SHALT THOU RETURN.
heretic-cinematic-ash-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-blade-1 = I rip through chains of dust and light. The moon waxes here, among the chosen.
heretic-cinematic-blade-2 = The serpent decapitated. Its poison gone. Rent with crescent blades of silver.
heretic-cinematic-blade-3 = A storm of steel, am I. CHAMPION OF THE TORN AND PURE.
heretic-cinematic-blade-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-lock-1 = The Stewards... I hear them, now. My friends in the misted sky.
heretic-cinematic-lock-2 = A Labyrinth meant to contain us now broken. Solved. A guiding string led through.
heretic-cinematic-lock-3 = We cannot be contained. WE CANNOT BE LOCKED AWAY.
heretic-cinematic-lock-punch = WITNESS OUR ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-flesh-1 = The heavens offered ideals and dreams. I desired more than that.
heretic-cinematic-flesh-2 = The Marshal leads my army. THE SKY CAN BLEED, AND I WILL DRAIN IT OF ITS ESSENCE.
heretic-cinematic-flesh-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-void-1 = The world falls into darkness. I stand in an empty plane; small flakes of ice fall from the sky.
heretic-cinematic-void-2 = The Aristocrat stands before me, beckoning. We will play a waltz to the whispers of dying reality.
heretic-cinematic-void-3 = The void will return all to nothing.
heretic-cinematic-void-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-rust-1 = Let me tell you a story. There are hills ahead, draped in rust.
heretic-cinematic-rust-2 = Rust that rots your heart. Mouth parched, soul weak, your tongue begins to bleed.
heretic-cinematic-rust-3 = I am decay incarnate. INEVITABLE AS A DYING STAR; IMPASSIVE AS THE WATERS.
heretic-cinematic-rust-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!

heretic-cinematic-cosmos-1 = The Beast held out its hand. I grabbed hold, and was pulled to them.
heretic-cinematic-cosmos-2 = Their body was towering, yet it seemed so small and feeble after all the tales compiled in my head.
heretic-cinematic-cosmos-3 = I closed my eyes, my head laid against their form. I was safe.
heretic-cinematic-cosmos-punch = WITNESS MY ASCENSION!
